/E (This report presents the implementation and evaluation of a Kohonen Self-Organizing Map \(SOM\) for the task of word clustering using Competitive Learning. Self-Organizing Maps are a type of unsupervised neural networks introduced by)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
74 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
