517 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 67 0 R
/T (7.3 Cluster Interpretability)
/E (7.3 Cluster Interpretability)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
518 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 67 0 R
/E (Based on the evaluation results, the highest Purity value was achieved at k = 9 with a score of 0.9574, while the highest Rand Index was achieved at k = 4 with a score of 0.9638.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
519 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 67 0 R
/E (The value k = 4 represents the actual number of semantic categories in the dataset, which allowed the SOM model to produce clusters that closely matched the ground-truth labels. On the other hand, larger values of k produced more specialized and homogeneous clusters, but increased the fragmentation of some categories.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
520 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 67 0 R
/E (Therefore, the choice of the optimal k depends on the evaluation objective. If the goal is to maximize agreement with the true categories, k = 4 is the best choice. However, if the goal is to obtain highly homogeneous clusters, k = 9 provides the highest Purity.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
521 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 67 0 R
/E (The contingency matrices show that the SOM model was generally successful in separating the semantic categories across different values of k. In most experiments, the Countries category formed highly distinct clusters compared to the other categories, indicating that country word embeddings possess more distinct semantic characteristics.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
522 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 67 0 R
/E (In contrast, the Animals, Fruits, and Veggies categories showed a higher degree of overlap in some clusters. This behavior is expected because these categories share similar semantic and contextual relationships within the GloVe embedding space.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
523 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 67 0 R
/E (At higher values of k, the SOM model was able to create more specialized clusters with less category overlap, which contributed to the improvement in Purity scores observed in the evaluation results.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
