531 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 68 0 R
/E (The experimental results demonstrate the ability of the SOM network to organize semantically similar words into meaningful clusters using Competitive Learning. In addition, contingency matrices and evaluation metrics were used to analyze the clustering performance under different SOM configurations. Overall, this assignment demonstrates the effectiveness of SOM as an unsupervised neural network for clustering high-dimensional word embeddings and analyzing semantic relationships between words.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [5]
>>
